    "Synthetic portal graphs use a validated carrier BSP but do not assert matching carrier spatial geometry; six native controls use a genuinely paired BSP/PRT.",
    "Analytic and feasibility oracles cover the repaired winding/capacity cases, not a proof of exact general PVS or safe automatic merging.",
